bot\">qrobot</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-04 10:41:45 +08:00\">1 day ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>claude 就算不封号 c20x 也不好用，chatgpt 20xpro 几乎天天重置，claude 有 4 小时限制， 基本上都会触发限制</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18049552\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/1effc6e6d7eff243eacbb1b8f81d325a?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"27149\" data-uid=\"45644\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/27149\">27149</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-04 10:41:59 +08:00\">1 day ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>20x 吧 GPT6 都来了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18049603\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/89d20e7d792c7ac827c5bf668e812d9d?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"lxxzml\" data-uid=\"389248\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/lxxzml\">lxxzml</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-04 10:47:08 +08:00\">1 day ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>claude 比 codex 编程强</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18049640\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d470/2f37/102538_normal.png?m=1788109509\" alt=\"rladmsrl\" data-uid=\"102538\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n         